# Route: guide 32 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 53 to
# 55, 23 quests, 1.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Western Plaguelands): Felstone Field -> Sorrow Hill -> Ruins of
# Andorhal -> Sorrow Hill -> Northridge Lumber Camp -> Felstone Field ->
# Northridge Lumber Camp -> Hearthglen -> The Weeping Cave -> Northridge
# Lumber Camp -> Hearthglen -> Northridge Lumber Camp -> Thondroril River ->
# ….
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the
# Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors
# (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), Oculus Illusions (6569).

